Driver functions:
    Thermometer
    Power meter
baylibre-acme - BayLibre ACME with 8 channels: P1_ENRG_PWR P1_ENRG_CURR P1_ENRG_VOL P2_ENRG_PWR P2_ENRG_CURR P2_ENRG_VOL P5_TEMP_IN P5_TEMP_OUT
Channel groups:
    Probe_1: channels P1_ENRG_PWR P1_ENRG_CURR P1_ENRG_VOL
    Probe_2: channels P2_ENRG_PWR P2_ENRG_CURR P2_ENRG_VOL
    Probe_5: channels P5_TEMP_IN P5_TEMP_OUT
Supported configuration options on channel group Probe_2:
    probe_factor: 10 (current)
    power_off: on, off (current)
